SUMMARY:Supporting Youth Mental Health in a Social Media World
DESCRIPTION:Join NJ4S for this FREE virtual event!\nThis program discusses youth mental health and the impact from social media including the benefits vs. risks.\nParents and caregivers will be offered: \n\nsafety tips\nways to set healthy limits\nhow to support safe practices\n\nClick here to register to attend.
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/supporting-youth-mental-health-in-a-social-media-world/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
