SUMMARY:Mental Health First Aid Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE\, in-person Mental Health First Aid Workshop on:\n Friday\, November 20\nfrom 9 AM to 5 PM\nat 33 South Fullerton Avenue\, Montclair NJ 07042. \nYou’ll learn how to recognize\, understand\, and respond to signs of mental health and substance use challenges\, along with how to offer the first level of support. \n🥪 Lunch will be provided! \nRegistration is required by the week of November 16. \nTo RSVP\, contact:\n📧 Eileen Strungis: estrungis@mhainspire.org\n📧 Mel Bryan: mbryan@mhainspire.org \n 
